        "text": "$$\n\\mathsf {c} _ {n - 1} = \\frac {- 1}{a _ {n - 1}} \\left| \\begin{array}{c c} a _ {n} & a _ {n - 2} \\\\ a _ {n - 1} & a _ {n - 3} \\end{array} \\right|,   \\mathsf {c} _ {n - 3} = \\frac {- 1}{a _ {n - 1}} \\left| \\begin{array}{c c} a _ {n} & a _ {n - 4} \\\\ a _ {n - 1} & a _ {n - 5} \\end{array} \\right|... \\tag {1.1}\n$$",
