        "text": "$$\n\\mathrm{d} _ {n - 1} = \\frac {- 1}{c _ {n - 1}} \\left| \\begin{array}{c c} a _ {n - 1} & a _ {n - 3} \\\\ c _ {n - 1} & c _ {n - 3} \\end{array} \\right|, \\mathrm{d} _ {n - 3} = \\frac {- 1}{a _ {n - 1}} \\left| \\begin{array}{c c} a _ {n - 1} & a _ {n - 5} \\\\ c _ {n - 1} & c _ {n - 5} \\end{array} \\right|...\n$$",
