    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "6、可逆系统的求解",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            483,
            327,
            502
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} & \\xrightarrow {f (t)} \\xrightarrow {h _ {1} (t)} \\xrightarrow {y (t)} \\xrightarrow {h _ {2} (t)} \\xrightarrow {f (t)} \\\\ & \\quad \\text {原系统} \\quad \\text {逆系统} \\\\ & \\quad y (t) = f (t) * h _ {1} (t) \\\\ & \\quad f (t) = y (t) * h _ {2} (t) \\\\ & \\quad f (t) = f (t) * h _ {1} (t) * h _ {2} (t) \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            336,
            510,
            668,
            661
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\Rightarrow$ 总系统：",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            667,
            238,
            683
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{c} h (t) = h _ {1} (t) * h _ {2} (t) = \\delta (t) \\\\ \\Rightarrow H _ {1} (s) \\cdot H _ {2} (s) = 1 \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            376,
            694,
            618,
            737
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "即逆系统的系统函数可用原系统的系统函数求倒数获得。",
        "bbox": [
            147,
            745,
            645,
            762
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
